meta {
  name: Admin.Gateway.API
  seq: 1
}

docs {
  Admin gateway ({{adminGateway}}) — the full Identity API. Run Accounts/Login first.

  Each area is one request per endpoint: List, Add (saves the new id), Details, Update, then the
  lifecycle actions and any sub-resources. Some requests use ids saved by another folder's Add request:
  - Scopes use operationId (Operations), Clients use scopeId (Scopes)
  - Roles use permissionId (Permissions), Users use roleId (Roles) and consentType (Consent Documents)
  - Add Client saves createdClientId — clientId stays the seeded client that Login signs in with.

  Needs data the run can't make: Delete Client/User Session (an existing session), Confirm User Totp
  (a code from the authenticator app), Confirm User and Recover User Password (the OTP service).
}
